---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import FitDiagnostic from '../../components/FitDiagnostic.astro';
// UTM contract: utm_content=go-digital-employees
---
<BaseLayout title="Digital Employees for Service Businesses | Buildwise Media" description="Learn what digital employees can do now, what comes next, and how to prove one useful job in a 45-day Pilot." noindex={true}>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Digital employees · One clear job at a time</p><!-- @bwm-exp-slot: hero-headline --><h1 data-bwm-exp-slot="hero-headline">Digital employees for a service business.</h1><p class="deck">Every business is short on one of three things: time, money, or A-players. Digital employees take the routine work the owner hates, so the humans can stay human.</p><div class="ctas"><!-- @bwm-exp-slot: hero-cta --><a class="cta" href="#diagnostic" data-cta-source="digital-employees-hero-primary" data-bwm-exp-slot="hero-cta">Get My Free Revenue Leak Map <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="cta-ghost" href="/book" data-cta-source="digital-employees-hero-secondary">See If We're a Fit</a></div><p class="qual mono">For established service businesses with real revenue. Owners looking for a savior bounce off — and that is the right outcome.</p></div>
<!-- @r020:F1 emotion: the calm outcomes image shows the human payoff of routine work leaving the owner's evening -->
<figure><img src="/images/bwm-outcomes-environmental-cinematic-v1.webp" alt="A quiet desk at dusk with a closed notebook and phone" width="640" height="426" loading="eager" decoding="async"/><figcaption class="mono">The owner gets the evening back.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="definition"><div class="container narrow"><p class="section-tag">PLAIN DEFINITION</p><h2>A digital employee is a role, not a chatbot.</h2><p>It has a clear job, rules, tools, and a scorecard. It handles repeat work across the systems your team already uses. It asks for help when judgment is needed.</p><p>The intelligence can cost pennies on the payroll dollar. That prices the intelligence, not our fee. Our fee covers the engineering, care, and upkeep of an engine you own.</p></div></section>
<section class="scope"><div class="container"><p class="section-tag">ONE INTENT · REAL SCOPE</p><h2>What digital employees do today.</h2><div class="cards"><article><span>AVAILABLE NOW</span><h3>Answering</h3><p>Reply to new calls and leads in seconds, using rules set with your team.</p></article><article><span>AVAILABLE NOW</span><h3>Follow-up</h3><p>Keep open quotes and quiet leads from falling through the cracks.</p></article><article><span>AVAILABLE NOW</span><h3>Scheduling</h3><p>Offer valid times, gather key details, and hand off clean notes.</p></article><article><span>AVAILABLE NOW</span><h3>Reporting</h3><p>Turn activity into a short weekly view an owner can use.</p></article></div>
<!-- @r020:F2 proof: the four-step work loop makes the present-day scope concrete and keeps future claims separate -->
<figure class="flow"><svg viewBox="0 0 800 170" role="img" aria-label="Digital employee work loop: answer, follow up, schedule, report"><rect x="25" y="50" width="150" height="70"/><rect x="225" y="50" width="150" height="70"/><rect x="425" y="50" width="150" height="70"/><rect x="625" y="50" width="150" height="70"/><path d="M175 85h50m150 0h50m150 0h50"/><text x="70" y="90">ANSWER</text><text x="263" y="90">FOLLOW UP</text><text x="463" y="90">SCHEDULE</text><text x="671" y="90">REPORT</text></svg><figcaption class="mono">A narrow job, completed and measured.</figcaption></figure>
<div class="next"><span class="next-label">BEING BUILT NEXT</span><h2>Deeper coordination across the week.</h2><p>We are building tighter handoffs across sales, service, and reporting. These features do not drive this page's offer. The reason to start is the work available now.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="pilot"><div class="container pilot-grid"><div><p class="section-tag">PROVE IT SMALL</p><h2>Start with one problem in a 45-day Pilot.</h2><p>The Pilot proves one useful job before the Ascend ladder continues: Pilot → Ascend → Pro. After day 90, service is month-to-month.</p><p>Digital employees can get smarter every few months as the system gains tested rules and better context. Humans still gate high-stakes decisions.</p></div><div class="box"><span class="mono">RISK REVERSAL</span><strong>One problem.<br/>45 days.<br/>Measured proof.</strong><p>If the first job does not hold up, there is no reason to climb.</p></div></div></section><FitDiagnostic /></main></BaseLayout>
<style>
.hero{padding:clamp(96px,11vw,160px) 0 80px}.hero-grid{display:grid;gap:48px;align-items:center}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,6.5vw,74px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.045em}.deck{font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,22px);line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-dim);max-width:760px}.ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:28px}.qual{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-faint);max-width:650px}figure img{width:100%;display:block}figcaption{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:10px}.definition,.scope,.pilot{padding:clamp(64px,8vw,112px) 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}.definition{background:var(--bg-elev)}.narrow{max-width:850px}h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4.5vw,52px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:20px 0}.definition p:not(.section-tag),.pilot p,.next p{color:var(--ink-dim);font-size:18px;line-height:1.7}.cards{display:grid;gap:1px;background:var(--rule);margin-top:40px}.cards article{background:var(--bg);padding:28px}.cards span,.next-label{font:700 9px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#050507;background:#F0FF00;padding:5px 7px}.cards h3{font-size:24px;margin:24px 0 10px}.cards p{color:var(--ink-dim);line-height:1.6}.flow{overflow:auto;margin:50px 0}.flow svg{min-width:760px;width:100%}.flow rect{fill:none;stroke:#62626A}.flow path{stroke:#F0FF00}.flow text{fill:#EDEDF0;font:11px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace}.next{border-left:3px solid #F0FF00;padding:10px 0 10px 28px;max-width:780px}.pilot{background:var(--bg-elev)}.pilot-grid{display:grid;gap:40px}.box{border:1px solid var(--rule);padding:32px}.box>span{font-size:10px;color:#F0FF00}.box strong{display:block;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);line-height:1.2;margin:24px 0}@media(min-width:800px){.cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.pilot-grid{grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr}}@media(min-width:900px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr}}
</style>
